---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ site.name }} — notary open late, Sunday notary, mobile notary"
  description: "Find a notary open late, a Sunday notary, or a mobile notary near me. Browse cities for evening, weekend, mobile, and online options, with hours and fees from public sources."
  updated: "{{ cities | latestCityUpdate }}"
---
<section class="page-hero wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">A public-source directory</p>
  <h1>{{ site.tagline }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ site.description }} We only list hours, fees, and services that a notary publishes, and we date every check. If we cannot verify it, it does not go on the page.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="cities">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Cities</h2>
    <p class="muted">Every city page is linked here and from its state index. Each city is one data file, so a new page can ship as soon as the listings are verified.</p>
  </div>
  {% for state in states %}
  <div class="state-block">
    <p class="state-name"><a href="/{{ state.stateSlug }}/">Notary open late in {{ state.stateName }}</a></p>
    <ul class="city-grid">
      {% for city in state.cities %}
      <li>
        <a class="city-card" href="{{ city | cityPath }}">
          <h3>{{ city.city }}, {{ city.state }}</h3>
          <p>Sunday notary and mobile notary near me{% if city.focus %} · {{ city.focus }} focus{% endif %} · {{ city.listings | length }} listings</p>
          <p class="small muted">Updated {{ city.lastUpdated | displayDate }}</p>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="wrap tonight">
  <h2>Why this directory exists</h2>
  <p>People looking for a notary after work often land on a bank branch or a shipping store that has already stopped taking walk-ins. This site is for the other options: notaries who come to you, stay open into the evening, work weekends, or can notarize online when the receiving party allows it.</p>
  <p><a href="/guides/notarize-after-hours-or-weekend/">How to get a document notarized after hours or on a weekend</a></p>
  <p><a href="/about/">How we research listings</a></p>
</section>
